The '''Path of Judgments''' was a location in [[Jedha City]],<ref name="UVG" /> a large, walled [[city]] on the<ref name="Galactic Atlas">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> [[Temperature|cold]], [[desert]] [[moon]]<ref name="Jedha DB">{{Databank|jedha|Jedha}}</ref> of [[Jedha]].<ref name="UVG" /> The Path of Judgments and the rest of NiJedha were [[Destruction of Jedha City|destroyed]] by a single-reactor [[superlaser]] blast from the newly-operational [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star]].<ref name="Rogue One">''[[Rogue One: A Star Wars Story]]''</ref>

